ESP-NIC 1.0.0 binary distribution
Based on Espressif Systems ESP-Hosted MCU snapshot 3.0.9 and its Arduino port.
Upstream frame/TLV headers carrying GPL-2.0-only OR Apache-2.0 are distributed
under the Apache-2.0 option. Original license/attribution rights are retained.

Modifications: opaque NIC facade, raw Ethernet receive queue, consolidated
precompiled objects, numeric diagnostics, removed private frame logs, symbol
localization/anonymization and stripped debug information. SDIO slave profiles
include the priority-queue/bounds repair of the unfinished packet-mode branch.

Arduino/ESP-IDF/STM32duino runtime dependencies are supplied by the installed
board cores and keep their own licenses. Included firmware contains SDK and
third-party components; copies of relevant license texts are in LICENSES/.
This notice does not replace or restrict those licenses. Binary-only delivery
does not create exclusive ownership of publicly available upstream algorithms.

